{"page":394,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:71","surah":28,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْتُمْ إِن جَعَلَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلَّيْلَ سَرْمَدًا إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ مَنْ إِلَـٰهٌ غَيْرُ ٱللَّهِ يَأْتِيكُم بِضِيَآءٍ ۖ أَفَلَا تَسْمَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘Just think, if God were to cast perpetual night over you until the Day of Resurrection, what god other than He could bring you light? Do you not listen?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"Have you seen","transliteration":"ara-aytum","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"Allah made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah made","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَرْمَدًا","en_gloss":"continuous","transliteration":"sarmadan","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"till","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(the) Day","transliteration":"yawmi","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌ","en_gloss":"(is the) god","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"غَيْرُ","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"ghayru","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَأْتِيكُم","en_gloss":"who could bring you","transliteration":"yatīkum","verse_key":"28:71"},{"pos":17