 not love those who do this,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱبْتَغِ","en_gloss":"But seek","transliteration":"wa-ib'taghi","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيمَآ","en_gloss":"through what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰكَ","en_gloss":"Allah has given you","transliteration":"ātāka","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has given you","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدَّارَ","en_gloss":"the home","transliteration":"l-dāra","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَنسَ","en_gloss":"forget","transliteration":"tansa","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَصِيبَكَ","en_gloss":"your share","transliteration":"naṣībaka","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","en_gloss":"the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَحْسِن","en_gloss":"And do good","transliteration":"wa-aḥsin","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَمَآ","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"Allah has been good","transliteration":"aḥsana","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has been good","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تَبْغِ","en_gloss":"seek","transliteration":"tabghi","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْفَسَادَ","en_gloss":"corruption","transliteration":"l-fasāda","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"28:77"},{"pos"